---
import Icon from "../design-system/Icon.astro";
---

{/* What this device holds of a card's item, after its facts: a green check once it was heard to the end
     and a blue download arrow once it is saved offline (owner, 2026-11-03; the Played mark returns,
     the Played word does not). Both are rendered hidden and shown by the card's own data-played and
     data-downloaded (library.css; cardProgress.ts and libraryMenu.ts set them), so a mark takes room
     only while it is shown and the facts before it never change. */}
<span class="status-mark status-mark-played"><Icon name="check" /><span class="sr-only">Played</span></span>
<span class="status-mark status-mark-downloaded"><Icon name="arrowLineDown" /><span class="sr-only">Downloaded</span></span>
